# MASTER3-OPENAPI-001: sha256 (LF-normalised) of every file under openapi/ at the CONTRACT_FREEZE state (Gate B-E amendments FA1..FA5
# plus FA6 = MASTER2-API-002 text change in profiles.yaml and errors.yaml, plus FA7 = MASTER5-OPENAPI-001 ETag response header on D1-11/12/13 in profiles.yaml, plus FA8 = MASTER6-IDEM-003 optional expectedRoleIds precondition on D1-26 in profiles.yaml, plus FA9 = MASTER6-OPENAPI-005 text-only nombreMostrar rules on AdminUserPatchRequest in profiles.yaml, plus FA10 = RC-12 text/maximum-only OffsetStrict parameter of D1-22 in pagination.yaml and profiles.yaml, plus FA11 = new news/news.yaml (D4-01..D4-11) and wallet/wallet.yaml (D6-01, D6-02) wired into root.yaml, NoticiaIdPath in identifiers.yaml and the OFFSET comment of pagination.yaml, plus FA12 = new moderation/moderation.yaml (moderation reads D5-20, D5-21, D5-22, D5-25, D5-26, D5-28, D5-29) and commerce/commerce.yaml (admin subscription list D7-27) wired into root.yaml, plus FA13 = admin catalog reads D7-17, D7-21, D6-18, D6-20, D6-22 and catalog upserts D7-22, D7-19 added to commerce/commerce.yaml and new dashboard/dashboard.yaml (dashboard overview D3-15) wired into root.yaml, plus FA14 = promotion use log D7-29 added to commerce/commerce.yaml and wired into root.yaml, plus FA15 = new billing/billing.yaml (billing history D7-05) and community/community.yaml (OposiRed categories D5-01, own OposiTester counters D5-16) and the product upsert D7-18 added to commerce/commerce.yaml, all wired into root.yaml, plus FA16 = DEC-015 decided by the owner on 2026-10-13 (the correction is revealed when the user answers, for the three exam types) in attempts/attempts.yaml: optional nullable esCorrecta and opcionCorrectaId added to AttemptQuestion.respuesta (D2-08) and text-only descriptions of D2-08, D2-09, AttemptGridItem.estado (D2-07) and AnswerResult.esCorrecta / opcionCorrectaId (D2-09); no operation, required field or error code added), plus FA17 = E1 exam-server amendment 2026-10-14 (owner decisions: immutable question revision bound at start, resources V1 image/audio, E2-S01 read limit; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER) in attempts/attempts.yaml and root.yaml: NEW operation D2-66 GET /api/v1/app/intentos/{attemptId}/recursos/{recursoId} (AttemptResourceAccess), NEW schemas AttemptResource / AudioEnvelope / AttemptResourceAccess, optional AttemptQuestion.recursos (D2-08), ReviewItem.resources items now AttemptResource (D2-65, previously always empty), RATE_LIMITED + 429 added to D2-07, D2-08 and D2-12, descriptions of D2-08 / D2-12 / D2-65 updated (content from the bound revision), plus FA18 = PHASE B 2026-10-14 in catalog/catalog.yaml: optional nullable AppExamDetail.ultimoIntentoFinalizadoId (D2-02, PERF01) and text-only descriptions of D2-02 and D2-17 (D2-17 now served by Ktor); no operation, required field or error code added. plus FA19 = E2-P02 PHASE B 2026-10-14 per-user read limits (CATALOG_READ 120/60 s shared by D2-01, D2-02, D2-13, D7-02; WALLET_READ 60/60 s shared by D6-01, D6-02): RATE_LIMITED + 429 added to D2-02 and D2-13 in catalog/catalog.yaml, D7-02 in entitlements/entitlements.yaml, D6-01 and D6-02 in wallet/wallet.yaml (D2-01 already declared it); no operation, field or schema added. plus FA20 = V1 STEP 2 2026-10-15 community mandatory (owner): optional nullable comunidadNombre (readable name) added to D2-01 AppExamSummary, D2-02 AppExamDetail, D2-13 MyExamRef and the D2-13 groups in catalog/catalog.yaml; AdminExamenCreateRequest now REQUIRES comunidadId and AdminExamenPatchRequest.comunidadId can no longer be null (422 EXAM_COMMUNITY_REQUIRED / UNKNOWN_COMMUNITY, 409 EXAM_PUBLISH_REQUIRES_COMMUNITY); no operation added. plus FA21 = V1 economy 2026-10-15 (owner scope change): new economy/economy.yaml adds as TARGET the OposiTickets commands D6-03 redeem, D6-11 packs, D6-12/D6-13/D6-14 payment orders and W-01 provider webhook (root.yaml paths and the payments tag), the economy error codes (errors.yaml EconomyErrorCode) and ErrorDetails.balance and ErrorDetails.price, plus optional nullable accesoValidoHasta on D2-02 AppExamDetail and the D2-13 MyExamItem and the ExamPrice meaning (OT price from the database, null when not purchasable) in catalog/catalog.yaml. plus FA22 = owner 2026-10-16: the specialty is set once (D1-13 409 SPECIALTY_ALREADY_SET) and is an access gate (D2-02/D2-03/D6-03 404 for another specialty, D2-01/D2-13 scoped to it), ORDER_PENDING_LIMIT. A contract edit, committed or not, changes a hash and
# fails OpenApiFreezeManifestTest; the amendment is then recorded in CONTRACT_FREEZE.md (OposiBot repo) and this manifest updated
